es a database and a processor. The database stores live video of the parking lot, data of vehicle, billing data, data of vehicles of drivers of the vehicle, computer readable instructions, and pre-trained artificial intelligence models. Herein, the backend server receives the video of the parking lot in real-time and number plate image of the vehicles in the parking lot from the primary node and the slave node, and the backend server executes the computer readable instructions that use the pre-trained artificial intelligence models to identify an accurate tally of parking lot occupancy and as well as identifies number plate of the vehicle entering and exiting the parking lot, thus helps in identifying the vehicle for tracking and billing, then the backend server sends live video feed, notifications, timeline of parking, and bill to the personal computing device.
