the primary node camera is initialized by the primary node;
the primary node camera captures the video continuous video of the parking lot and sends the video to the backend server through the primary node;
the backend server executes the computer readable instructions that use pre-trained artificial intelligence models to identify an accurate tally of parking lot occupancy;
