The present invention also provides a process for preparation of compound of structural formula (I), the process comprises:
adding ethyl 2-amino-4-methylthiazole-5-carboxylate and glacial acetic acid to a solution of a pyrazole derivative and a solvent to obtain a reaction mixture;
refluxing the reaction mixture at 50oC to 60oC for 6-8 hours followed by cooling to obtain a solid precipitate;
isolating and filtering the solid precipitate by evaporating the solvent to obtain a crude product; and
purifying the crude product to obtain compound of structural formula (I).

The pyrazole derivative is selected from the compounds:
3-(1,3-diphenyl)-1-phenyl-1-H-pyrazole-4-carbaldehyde;
